{
  "_help": [
    "Each block is one line of the template week.",
    "days: 1 = Monday ... 7 = Sunday. daysFrom: take the days from Settings (work, muayThai, football).",
    "start / end: a clock time like 18:15, or an anchor from Settings like @wake+15 or @sleep-60.",
    "Anchors: @wake, @sleep, @work.start, @work.end, @leave, @home, @muayThai.start, @muayThai.end, @football.start, @football.end, @iftar, @suhoor.",
    "duration is in minutes (use it instead of end). track: can be marked done. counts: false keeps it out of adherence.",
    "stage: the unlock stage (see program.json). phases: only shown in these phases. when: normal or ramadan.",
    "min: the minimum version for a bad day. Doing it counts as kept."
  ],

